    founder: {
      id: "founder",
      status: "public",
      title: "Founder / Music Fun 100",
      intro: "Music Fun 100 was created from Waice's belief that music has no borders, and that music education should not be limited by geography.",
      letter: [
        "Dear teachers, students and parents,",
        "Music has shaped my life in many meaningful ways.",
        "Through music, I met teachers who guided me, inspired me and helped me understand not only how to perform, but how to grow as a person. Through teaching, I have been able to share what I learned with students from different places, and to see music become part of their confidence, happiness and friendships.",
        "For more than 24 years, I have seen how music can change a student's life. It can help a child express emotions, build discipline, make new friends, and discover a stronger sense of self.",
        "I also understand the reality faced by many music teachers. Not every musician has the time, resources or confidence to build a social media platform, promote their work, communicate with parents and create a stable teaching career on their own.",
        "This is one of the reasons I founded Music Fun 100.",
        "My hope is to build a platform where music teachers are supported, students can find inspiring learning opportunities, and parents can communicate with teachers through respect, clarity and trust.",
        "Looking ahead, I hope Music Fun 100 can help students access more international music information and opportunities, including competitions, festivals, exchanges and learning experiences that broaden their musical vision.",
        "At the heart of this vision is a simple belief: music has no borders. I hope Music Fun 100 can help music education move beyond geographical limits, connecting teachers, students and parents with higher standards of learning, broader cultural understanding and a truly global musical community.",
        "To me, music education is not only about lessons. It is about helping people connect, grow, and carry music into their lives with confidence, joy and a wider view of the world.",
        "With gratitude,",
        "Waice Che",
      ],
      ctas: [
        { label: "Join as a Teacher", url: "https://musicfun100.com" },
        { label: "Find a Music Teacher", url: "https://musicfun100.com" },
      ],
    },
