      "Musician · Educator · Entrepreneur": "音樂人 · 教育者 · 創業者",
      "With 24 years of music education experience, a cross-cultural teaching background and an entrepreneurial perspective, Waice Che founded Music Fun 100 to make trusted, international music education more accessible to teachers, students and parents.": "Waice Che 擁有 24 年音樂教育經驗、跨文化教學背景及創業視野。她創立 Music Fun 100，希望讓值得信任、具國際視野的音樂教育，更容易連接老師、學生與家長。",
      "Every teacher deserves to be seen. Every student deserves a wider world through music.": "每一位老師都值得被看見，每一位學生都值得透過音樂看見更大的世界。",
      "Founder Introduction Video": "創辦人介紹影片",
      "Replace this placeholder with Waice's YouTube founder introduction video thumbnail.": "之後可替換成 Waice 的 YouTube 創辦人介紹影片封面。",
      "A personal introduction from Waice about music education, online teaching, business experience and the vision behind Music Fun 100.": "Waice 親自介紹她的音樂教育、線上教學、商業背景，以及 Music Fun 100 背後的願景。",
      "24 Years": "24 年",
      "Music education experience": "音樂教育經驗",
      "Global Students": "全球學生",
      "Online teaching across regions": "跨地區線上教學",
      "Students from Canada, United States, Australia, New Zealand, Thailand, Singapore, Italy, UK, Japan, China, Hong Kong, Macau, and more.": "學生來自加拿大、美國、澳洲、新西蘭、泰國、新加坡、意大利、英國、日本、中國、香港、澳門等地",
      "Founder Vision": "創辦人願景",
      "Making music education more accessible": "讓音樂教育更容易接觸",
      "A New Path for Music Education": "音樂教育的新方向",
      "WAICE has nearly four years of online teaching experience. Several of her students from different regions have won first prizes in various music competitions. Based on this experience, she believes that instrumental music education should no longer be limited by geography. She hopes to challenge the traditional, location-based model of instrumental teaching by helping more teachers find suitable students and stable teaching opportunities, while sharing her years of experience with every teacher who joins Music Fun 100. Music Fun 100 is committed to actively supporting and respecting every participating teacher, protecting their teaching time and best interests. At the same time, the platform hopes to provide students around the world with more international music education and broader perspectives, helping them enrich their lives through music.": "WAICE 本人擁有近四年的線上教學經驗。來自不同地區的多位學生曾在不同音樂比賽中獲得第一名。因此，她相信樂器教學不應再受地域限制。她希望打破傳統樂器教學的地域模式，幫助更多老師找到合適的學生及穩定的工作機會，並將多年累積的豐富經驗分享給 Music Fun 100 的每一位老師。Music Fun 100 將積極支持並尊重每一位加入的老師，保障老師的教學時間及最大利益。同時，平台亦希望全球學生能夠接受更國際化的音樂教育，拓展視野，透過音樂豐盛人生。",
      "Founder Experience": "創辦人經歷",
      "Flute and harp music training with accurate institutional wording.": "以準確、不誇大的方式呈現長笛與豎琴音樂訓練。",
      "Personal youth music competition achievements from Macau.": "Waice 在澳門青年音樂比賽中的個人成就。",
      "Students from different regions achieving strong results through online learning.": "不同地區學生在線上學習中取得良好成績。",
      "Business, public image and international exchange experience.": "商業、公眾形象及國際交流經驗。",
      "About Waice": "關於 Waice",
      "WAICE is a Macau-born musician, educator, entrepreneur and senior model. She has taught at several renowned primary and secondary schools in Macao and has served as a guest etiquette instructor at a university.": "WAICE 是出生於澳門的音樂人、教育家、企業家及資深模特兒。她曾任教於澳門多間知名中、小學，並曾擔任大學客席禮儀導師。",
      "From Music Training to Teaching": "從音樂訓練到教學",
      "WAICE began receiving formal music training at the Macao Conservatory of Music during her secondary-school years. In addition to flute and harp performance studies, she also studied ear training, music theory and other related subjects. She regularly took part in the conservatory's assessments and quarterly performances. At the same time, she actively participated in the Macau Young Musicians Competition, gaining extensive stage and performance experience.\n\nDuring her youth, she performed as a flutist and harpist with the Macao Youth Wind Band, the Macao Youth Symphony Orchestra and the Macao Conservatory Symphony Orchestra. She also regularly participated in exchange performances with the Macao Orchestra and performed with the orchestra as a guest flutist. These experiences established her as an experienced musician with a strong background in live performance.\n\nShe was introduced to music teaching during her secondary-school years. Her teaching career began with flute instruction at Kang Pang School in Macao and at private music centres. She later taught flute at several well-known primary and secondary schools in Macao.\n\nHer teaching philosophy has always centred on each student's personal growth. Through encouragement and joyful teaching, she hopes to help students genuinely enjoy the process of learning music.\n\nDuring her youth, she obtained Grade 8 flute and Grade 5 music theory certificates from the Royal Academy of Music in the United Kingdom.": "WAICE 從中學時期便在澳門演藝學院接受正規音樂訓練。除了長笛獨奏及豎琴獨奏外，她亦修讀視唱練耳、樂理等課程，並定期接受學院考核及參與季度演出。同時，她積極參與澳門青年音樂比賽，累積了豐富的舞台及演出經驗。\n\n青少年時期，她曾擔任澳門青年管樂團、澳門青年交響樂團及澳門演藝學院交響樂團的長笛手及豎琴手，並經常與澳門樂團參與交流演出，亦曾以客席長笛手身份於澳門樂團演出。這些經歷使她成為一名擁有豐富舞台經驗的資深樂手。\n\n在中學時期，她開始接觸音樂教學，並由澳門鏡平學校及私人音樂中心展開長笛教學工作。其後，她先後於多間澳門知名中小學任教長笛。\n\n她的教學核心始終以學生的個人成長為本，透過鼓勵及愉快的教學方式，讓學生真正享受學習音樂的過程。\n\n青少年時期，她已考獲英國皇家音樂學院八級長笛及五級樂理證書。",
      "What Music Has Given Me": "音樂帶給我的意義",
      "Founder Journey": "創辦人旅程",
      "Flute and Harp Education at Macau Music Conservatory & National Music Institute of Costa Rica": "澳門音樂學院及哥斯達黎加國立音樂學院的長笛與豎琴教育",
      "Flute & Harp Studies": "長笛與豎琴學習",
      "Waice studied flute with renowned Macao teacher Liu Chang; Dr. Angela Roland from the United States, a former flutist of the Macao Orchestra; and renowned flutist Gabriel Goni, principal flutist of the Costa Rica National Orchestra. She studied harp with Li Li Qun, a China National First-Class Artist, and Professor Guan Xian Yue, and also received guidance from LAUYEE YEUNG and JUDY HO.": "長笛師從澳門名師劉暢老師、美國 Angela Roland 博士（澳門樂團前長笛手），以及知名長笛家 Gabriel Goni（哥斯達黎加國家樂團首席長笛手）。豎琴師從中國國家一級藝術演員李麗群老師及 Guan Xian Yue 教授，並曾接受 LAUYEE YEUNG 及 JUDY HO 的指導。",
