      "Member of the Costa Rica National Flute Orchestra.": "哥斯達黎加國家長笛樂團成員。",
      "Waice Che performing flute with the Costa Rica National Youth Wind Band": "Waice Che 在哥斯達黎加國家青年管樂團演奏長笛",
