      "Flutist and harpist of the Macao Conservatory of Music Orchestra.": "澳門演藝學院音樂學校管弦樂團長笛手及豎琴手。",
      "Flutist of the Macao Pooi Ching Symphonic Band.": "澳門培道中學管樂團長笛手。",
      "Flutist of the Macao Youth Symphony Orchestra.": "澳門青年交響樂團長笛手。",
      "Music Performance Photos": "音樂演出相片",
      "During her youth, WAICE was active in Macao's music scene, regularly participating in competitions and performances. She performed as a flutist with several wind bands and orchestras, and remained actively involved in master classes and musical exchanges. She was often invited to perform at government events and for world-renowned brands such as Cartier, Tiffany & Co. and Bulgari. In recent years, she has actively performed with the Costa Rica National Flute Orchestra and was invited to perform with the orchestra at a flute convention in the United States.": "WAICE 青少年時期活躍於澳門樂壇，經常參與比賽及演出，是多個管樂團及管弦樂團的長笛手，並一直積極參與大師班及音樂交流。她曾獲邀出席政府及卡地亞、Tiffany、寶格麗等世界知名品牌的演出。近年，她積極參與哥斯達黎加國家長笛樂團演出，並隨團獲邀到美國長笛大會演出。",
      "Concert of the Night of Mozart at Macau Cultural Centre": "澳門文化中心《莫扎特之夜》音樂會",
      "Flute Solo Performance at Macau Culture Centre": "澳門文化中心長笛獨奏演出",
      "Master Class of Paul Edmund-Davies": "Paul Edmund-Davies 大師班",
      "Master Class of Trevor Wye": "Trevor Wye 大師班",
      "Flute Choir Performance with TIM WILSON": "與 TIM WILSON 一同進行長笛合奏演出",
      "Flute Choir Performance with William Bennett": "與 William Bennett 一同進行長笛合奏演出",
      "WAICE previously served as Vice President of the Macau Youth Music Promotion Association.\n\nThe Macau Musicians Concert was one of the events organized by the association.\n\nShe has also served as an adjudicator for singing competitions at different music schools in Macao.": "WAICE 曾擔任澳門青年音樂推廣協會副會長。\n\n《澳門演奏家音樂會專場》是該協會舉辦的活動之一。\n\n她亦曾擔任澳門不同音樂學校歌唱比賽的評委。",
      "Mia Ieong won Second Prize at the IX International Liszt Ferenc Final Round Competition 2026 (Hungary Eger)": "楊淇菁 Mia Ieong 於 2026 年第九屆李斯特匈牙利國際公開賽決賽（匈牙利埃格爾）榮獲第二名",
      "Student Individual Honour": "學生個人榮耀",
      "Global Online Learning Results": "全球線上學習成果",
      "Angie and Mia are both my online students. They became good friends through music. I love connecting my students and helping them support each other on their musical journeys.\n\nThey participated in flute solo competitions and performed as a duet together. As their teacher, seeing them build a friendship and make music happily is the greatest blessing!": "Angie 與 Mia 都是我的線上學生。她們因音樂成為好朋友。我很喜歡連結我的學生，幫助她們在音樂道路上互相支持。\n\n她們參加了長笛獨奏比賽，並一起以二重奏形式演出。作為她們的老師，看著她們建立友誼，快樂地一起演奏，是最大的祝福！",
