      "With 24 years of music education experience, a cross-cultural teaching background and an entrepreneurial perspective, Waice Che founded Music Fun 100 to make trusted, international music education more accessible to teachers, students and parents.": "Waice Che 拥有 24 年音乐教育经验、跨文化教学背景及创业视野。她创立 Music Fun 100，希望让值得信任、具国际视野的音乐教育，更容易连接老师、学生与家长。",
