      "Making music education more accessible": "让音乐教育更容易接触",
      "A New Path for Music Education": "音乐教育的新方向",
      "WAICE has nearly four years of online teaching experience. Several of her students from different regions have won first prizes in various music competitions. Based on this experience, she believes that instrumental music education should no longer be limited by geography. She hopes to challenge the traditional, location-based model of instrumental teaching by helping more teachers find suitable students and stable teaching opportunities, while sharing her years of experience with every teacher who joins Music Fun 100. Music Fun 100 is committed to actively supporting and respecting every participating teacher, protecting their teaching time and best interests. At the same time, the platform hopes to provide students around the world with more international music education and broader perspectives, helping them enrich their lives through music.": "WAICE 本人拥有近四年的线上教学经验。来自不同地区的多位学生曾在不同音乐比赛中获得第一名。因此，她相信乐器教学不应再受地域限制。她希望打破传统乐器教学的地域模式，帮助更多老师找到合适的学生及稳定的工作机会，并将多年积累的丰富经验分享给 Music Fun 100 的每一位老师。Music Fun 100 将积极支持并尊重每一位加入的老师，保障老师的教学时间及最大利益。同时，平台也希望全球学生能够接受更国际化的音乐教育，拓展视野，通过音乐丰富人生。",
