      "About Waice": "关于 Waice",
      "WAICE is a Macau-born musician, educator, entrepreneur and senior model. She has taught at several renowned primary and secondary schools in Macao and has served as a guest etiquette instructor at a university.": "WAICE 是出生于澳门的音乐人、教育家、企业家及资深模特儿。她曾任教于澳门多间知名中、小学，并曾担任大学客席礼仪导师。",
      "From Music Training to Teaching": "从音乐训练到教学",
      "WAICE began receiving formal music training at the Macao Conservatory of Music during her secondary-school years. In addition to flute and harp performance studies, she also studied ear training, music theory and other related subjects. She regularly took part in the conservatory's assessments and quarterly performances. At the same time, she actively participated in the Macau Young Musicians Competition, gaining extensive stage and performance experience.\n\nDuring her youth, she performed as a flutist and harpist with the Macao Youth Wind Band, the Macao Youth Symphony Orchestra and the Macao Conservatory Symphony Orchestra. She also regularly participated in exchange performances with the Macao Orchestra and performed with the orchestra as a guest flutist. These experiences established her as an experienced musician with a strong background in live performance.\n\nShe was introduced to music teaching during her secondary-school years. Her teaching career began with flute instruction at Kang Pang School in Macao and at private music centres. She later taught flute at several well-known primary and secondary schools in Macao.\n\nHer teaching philosophy has always centred on each student's personal growth. Through encouragement and joyful teaching, she hopes to help students genuinely enjoy the process of learning music.\n\nDuring her youth, she obtained Grade 8 flute and Grade 5 music theory certificates from the Royal Academy of Music in the United Kingdom.": "WAICE 从中学时期便在澳门演艺学院接受正规音乐训练。除了长笛独奏及竖琴独奏外，她亦修读视唱练耳、乐理等课程，并定期接受学院考核及参与季度演出。同时，她积极参与澳门青年音乐比赛，积累了丰富的舞台及演出经验。\n\n青少年时期，她曾担任澳门青年管乐团、澳门青年交响乐团及澳门演艺学院交响乐团的长笛手及竖琴手，并经常与澳门乐团参与交流演出，亦曾以客席长笛手身份于澳门乐团演出。这些经历使她成为一名拥有丰富舞台经验的资深乐手。\n\n在中学时期，她开始接触音乐教学，并由澳门镜平学校及私人音乐中心展开长笛教学工作。其后，她先后于多间澳门知名中小学任教长笛。\n\n她的教学核心始终以学生的个人成长为本，通过鼓励及愉快的教学方式，让学生真正享受学习音乐的过程。\n\n青少年时期，她已考获英国皇家音乐学院八级长笛及五级乐理证书。",
      "What Music Has Given Me": "音乐带给我的意义",
      "Founder Journey": "创办人旅程",
      "Flute and Harp Education at Macau Music Conservatory & National Music Institute of Costa Rica": "澳门音乐学院及哥斯达黎加国立音乐学院的长笛与竖琴教育",
      "Flute & Harp Studies": "长笛与竖琴学习",
      "Waice studied flute with renowned Macao teacher Liu Chang; Dr. Angela Roland from the United States, a former flutist of the Macao Orchestra; and renowned flutist Gabriel Goni, principal flutist of the Costa Rica National Orchestra. She studied harp with Li Li Qun, a China National First-Class Artist, and Professor Guan Xian Yue, and also received guidance from LAUYEE YEUNG and JUDY HO.": "长笛师从澳门名师刘畅老师、来自美国的 Angela Roland 博士（澳门乐团前长笛手）及知名长笛家 Gabriel Goni（哥斯达黎加国家乐团首席）竖琴师从李丽群老师（中国国家一级演员），管弦乐老师，并曾接受 LAUYEE YEUNG 及 JUDY HO 的指导。",
