      "Music Performance Photos": "音乐演出照片",
      "During her youth, WAICE was active in Macao's music scene, regularly participating in competitions and performances. She performed as a flutist with several wind bands and orchestras, and remained actively involved in master classes and musical exchanges. She was often invited to perform at government events and for world-renowned brands such as Cartier, Tiffany & Co. and Bulgari. In recent years, she has actively performed with the Costa Rica National Flute Orchestra and was invited to perform with the orchestra at a flute convention in the United States.": "WAICE 青少年时期活跃于澳门乐坛，经常参加比赛及演出，是多个管乐团及管弦乐团的长笛手，并一直积极参与大师班及音乐交流。她曾获邀出席政府及卡地亚、Tiffany、宝格丽等世界知名品牌的演出。近年，她积极参与哥斯达黎加国家长笛乐团演出，并随团获邀到美国长笛大会演出。",
