      "Global Online Learning Results": "全球线上学习成果",
      "Angie and Mia are both my online students. They became good friends through music. I love connecting my students and helping them support each other on their musical journeys.\n\nThey participated in flute solo competitions and performed as a duet together. As their teacher, seeing them build a friendship and make music happily is the greatest blessing!": "Angie 与 Mia 都是我的线上学生。她们因音乐成为好朋友。我很喜欢连接我的学生，帮助她们在音乐道路上互相支持。\n\n她们参加了长笛独奏比赛，并一起以二重奏形式演出。作为她们的老师，看着她们建立友谊，快乐地一起演奏，是最大的祝福！",
      "Student competition achievements, music academy certificates and ensemble leadership outcomes from WAICE's online teaching experience.": "WAICE 线上教学经验中的学生比赛成绩、音乐学院证书及乐团领导成果。",
